OL,3,GNEWSACare home resident 'covered in
OL,4,Ablood' at breakfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report also said one resident who
OL,7,Fdisplayed "sexualised behaviours"
OL,8,Ftowards others was put in a room next
OL,9,Fto two vulnerable people who were
OL,10,Funable to move without staff help, the
OL,11,Freport found. Another vulnerable person
OL,12,Ffell into building works at the site,
OL,13,Fand "excessively full" fly papers were
OL,14,Ffound dangling above people's chairs.
OL,16,FThe home said it had made improvements
OL,17,Ffollowing the CQC's visit.
